1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,120
MEN: Can you come over tonight and help me set up my new computer

2
00:00:05,120 --> 00:00:07,180
and printer? They arrived this morning.

3
00:00:07,180 --> 00:00:11,960
WOMAN: Sure, but new computers are usually easy to set up these days

4
00:00:12,440 --> 00:00:14,250
It's usually just plug and play.

5
00:00:14,250 --> 00:00:18,521
MEN: I'd feel better if I had someone who knew what they were doing there.

6
00:00:18,521 --> 00:00:20,230
I'm worried I'll do something wrong.

7
00:00:20,230 --> 00:00:25,460
WOMAN: Fine. I'll get you connected to the Internet and hook up the printer for you

8
00:00:25,580 --> 00:00:28,180
But dinner's on you, OK?
